              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Data Files: Output from fly tracker that contain the following columns:<br/>\r\nColumn 1: Frame in video<br/>\r\nColumn 2: On/Off status of left red LED<br/>\r\nColumn 3: On/Off status of right red LED<br/>\r\nColumn 4: X position of fly<br/>\r\nColumn 5: Y position of fly<br/></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Data files are organised in four folders according to the figure they relate to.<br/>\r\nFolders Figure4-6 contain each a subfolder for Gr28bd mutants and a subfolder for TrpA1 mutants.<br/>\r\nThe naming convention is Experiment_flysex_flynumber_output.csv.</p>\r\n"
                },
